# PERMISSION-MODE-CASE: `/permissions full`, a word fx's parse refuses
# (`config_runtime.zig:3158@481104fd`). fx's composer completes it from the
# argument menu before Enter (to `full-access`), and so does xfx's since
# SLASH-ARG-SKILLS (train 16 joined the two lines; docs/parity.md, the
# `/permissions` row): both set full access, say so, and the saying goes.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 2
type /permissions full
wait 0.5
snap typed
key Enter
until shown Full access
until gone Full access
snap full
home end
